#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:111
msgid "Tested Models"
msgstr "已测试模型"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:113
msgid "Batch invariance has been tested and verified on the following models:"
msgstr "批次不变性已在以下模型上测试并验证："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:115
msgid "**Qwen3 (Dense)**: `Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B`, `Qwen/Qwen3-8B`"
msgstr "**Qwen3 (密集)**: `Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B`, `Qwen/Qwen3-8B`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:116
msgid "**Qwen3 (MoE)**: `Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B`, `Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B`"
msgstr "**Qwen3 (MoE)**: `Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B`, `Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:118
msgid ""
"Other models may also work, but these have been explicitly validated. If you"
" encounter issues with a specific model, please report them on the [GitHub "
"issue tracker](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/issues/new/choose)."
msgstr ""
"其他模型也可能适用，但这些模型已明确验证。如果您在特定模型上遇到问题，请在 [GitHub "
"问题跟踪器](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/new/choose) 上报告。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:120
msgid "Implementation Details"
msgstr "实现细节"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:122
msgid "When batch invariance is enabled, vLLM:"
msgstr "启用批次不变性后，vLLM："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:124
msgid ""
"Uses deterministic kernel implementations for attention and other operations"
msgstr "对注意力和其他操作使用确定性内核实现"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:125
msgid "Ensures consistent numerical behavior across different batch sizes"
msgstr "确保不同批次大小下的数值行为一致"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:126
msgid "Disables certain optimizations that may introduce non-determinism"
msgstr "禁用可能引入非确定性的某些优化"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:129
msgid ""
"The batch invariance attention operators currently do not support "
"`FULL','FULL_DECODE_ONLY` cudagraph mode."
msgstr "批量不变性注意力算子目前不支持 `FULL','FULL_DECODE_ONLY` cudagraph 模式。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md:134
msgid ""
"Enabling batch invariance may impact performance compared to the default "
"non-deterministic mode. This trade-off is intentional to guarantee "
"reproducibility."
msgstr "与默认的非确定性模式相比，启用批次不变性可能会影响性能。这种权衡是故意的，以保证可复现性。"

